  (text "-18V4\n- U102 LT3757 Cuk (inverting) -> -18V4. FBX = -0.8 V x (1 + 110k/4.99k).\n- Diode anode at the switch-side node X2, cathode to GND; output inductor from X2 to -18V4_SW."
    (at 20 257 0)
